* `Err(String)` - Error message if the input is invalid\n///\n/// # Errors\n///\n/// Returns an error if:\n/// - The input has an odd nu', ast_hash = 'seed_hash', commit_sha = 'HEAD', original_authors = ['TheAlgorithms Community'], keywords = ['ciphers', 'base16'], license_spdx = 'MIT', origin_repo = 'repo:rust', origin_path = 'problems/ciphers/base16';
