0];\n        let weights = vec![10.0, 10.0, 10.0, 4.0, 2.0];\n        assert_eq!(fractional_knapsack(capacity, weights, values), 83.0);\n    }\n\n    #[test]\n    #[shoul', ast_hash = 'seed_hash', commit_sha = 'HEAD', original_authors = ['TheAlgorithms Community'], keywords = ['dynamic_programming', 'fractional_knapsack'], license_spdx = 'MIT', origin_repo = 'repo:rust', origin_path = 'problems/dynamic_programming/fractional_knapsack';
