, 0, 1, 0, 1],\n            vec![1, 1, 1, 0, 1],\n            vec![0, 0, 0, 0, 1],\n            vec![1, 1, 1, 0, 1],\n        ];\n        let source = (2, 1)', ast_hash = 'seed_hash', commit_sha = 'HEAD', original_authors = ['TheAlgorithms Community'], keywords = ['graph', 'lee_breadth_first_search'], license_spdx = 'MIT', origin_repo = 'repo:rust', origin_path = 'problems/graph/lee_breadth_first_search';
