, 0.0),\n            (vec![2.0], 0.0),\n            (vec![3.0], 0.0),\n            (vec![8.0], 1.0),\n            (vec![9.0], 1.0),\n            (vec![10.0], 1', ast_hash = 'seed_hash', commit_sha = 'HEAD', original_authors = ['TheAlgorithms Community'], keywords = ['machine_learning', 'k_nearest_neighbors'], license_spdx = 'MIT', origin_repo = 'repo:rust', origin_path = 'problems/machine_learning/k_nearest_neighbors';
