lus` - The modulus to perform the operation under\n///\n/// # Returns\n///\n/// The result of `base` raised to `power` modulo `modulus`.\npub fn m', ast_hash = 'seed_hash', commit_sha = 'HEAD', original_authors = ['TheAlgorithms Community'], keywords = ['math', 'modular_exponential'], license_spdx = 'MIT', origin_repo = 'repo:rust', origin_path = 'problems/math/modular_exponential';
